sect1.para:
Inside and outside nodes start out to be matched (by point location). Because of their different ordering (demanded to get the correct normals), the first inside node matches the last outside node. It follows that auton_nodes=FE()->Nodes()//ofthefiniteelementtypeoftheinterface.
for(autoi{0U};i<n_nodes;i++)
assert(N(0,INSIDE)->Coordinate()==N(n_nodes-i-1U,OUTSIDE)->Coordinate());
 should not fail.
